# The expected digests for the published worktree-gate release assets are
# committed here when the release workflow runs (task 0.7): one
#   <sha256>  worktree-gate-<goos>-<goarch>
# line per supported target (darwin/arm64, darwin/amd64, linux/amd64,
# linux/arm64). No binaries are ever committed — this file is the trust root.
#
# Reproduce any digest locally with:
#   scripts/build-gate.sh
#   shasum -a 256 dist/worktree-gate-*
